{"seq":3,"slug":"state-hoisting-patterns","title":"状态提升模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/architecture/state-hoisting-patterns","wordCount":594,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态提升模式\">状态提升模式</h1><p>状态提升（State Hoisting）是 Compose 架构的基石模式——将状态从使用它的 Composable 上移到调用者，使组件变为无状态（stateless）。这一模式直接决定了组件的可测试性、可复用性以及整体应用的数据流清晰度。但在复杂应用中，&quot;提升到哪一层&quot;并非显而易见——过度提升导致 prop drilling，提升不足导致状态分散。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>状态提升的本质是关注点分离：让&quot;持有状态&quot;和&quot;展示 UI&quot;成为两个独立职责。Compose 通过参数传递实现单向数据流——状态向下流动（参数），事件向上冒泡（lambda 回调）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;状态持有者 (ViewModel / Holder)&quot;] --&gt;|state ↓| B[&quot;有状态 Composable (Screen)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|state ↓| C[&quot;无状态 Composable (Component)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|event ↑| B&#10;    B --&gt;|event ↑| A&#10;&#10;    subgraph 单向数据流&#10;        D[&quot;State 向下&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;Event 向上&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[\"状态持有者 (ViewModel / Holder)\"] --&gt;|state ↓| B[\"有状态 Composable (Screen)\"]\n    B --&gt;|state ↓| C[\"无状态 Composable (Component)\"]\n    C --&gt;|event ↑| B\n    B --&gt;|event ↑| A\n\n    subgraph 单向数据流\n        D[\"State 向下\"] --&gt; E[\"Event 向上\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>提升层级</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Composable 内部 <code>remember</code></td>\n<td>纯 UI 状态，无外部依赖</td>\n<td>组件存在周期</td>\n<td>展开/折叠、输入焦点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Screen-level Composable</td>\n<td>多个子组件共享的 UI 状态</td>\n<td>页面存在周期</td>\n<td>表单验证、列表选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ViewModel</td>\n<td>需要跨配置变更存活的业务状态</td>\n<td>Activity/NavBackStackEntry</td>\n<td>用户数据、加载状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Composition Local</td>\n<td>跨越多层传递但变化频率低的环境值</td>\n<td>提供者存在周期</td>\n<td>主题、Locale、导航控制器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"无状态组件设计\">无状态组件设计</h2><p>状态提升后的组件接收状态+回调，自身不持有任何 <code>remember</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 有状态版本（不推荐在库组件中使用）&#10;@Composable&#10;fun CounterBad() {&#10;    var count by remember { mutableStateOf(0) }&#10;    Button(onClick = { count++ }) {&#10;        Text(&quot;Count: $count&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 无状态版本（可复用、可测试、可预览）&#10;@Composable&#10;fun Counter(&#10;    count: Int,&#10;    onIncrement: () -&gt; Unit,&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier&#10;) {&#10;    Button(onClick = onIncrement, modifier = modifier) {&#10;        Text(&quot;Count: $count&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 调用方持有状态&#10;@Composable&#10;fun CounterScreen() {&#10;    var count by remember { mutableStateOf(0) }&#10;    Counter(count = count, onIncrement = { count++ })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 有状态版本（不推荐在库组件中使用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CounterBad() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var count by remember { mutableStateOf(0) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Button(onClick = { count++ }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(\"Count: $count\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 无状态版本（可复用、可测试、可预览）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Counter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count: Int,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onIncrement: () -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Button(onClick = onIncrement, modifier = modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(\"Count: $count\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 调用方持有状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CounterScreen() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var count by remember { mutableStateOf(0) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Counter(count = count, onIncrement = { count++ })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"state-holder-模式\">State Holder 模式</h2><p>当 UI 状态逻辑变得复杂但不涉及业务数据时，使用 plain class 作为 State Holder：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// State Holder：封装复杂 UI 逻辑&#10;class SearchBarState(&#10;    initialQuery: String = &quot;&quot;,&#10;    private val coroutineScope: CoroutineScope&#10;) {&#10;    var query by mutableStateOf(initialQuery)&#10;        private set&#10;&#10;    var suggestions by mutableStateOf&lt;List&lt;String&gt;&gt;(emptyList())&#10;        private set&#10;&#10;    var isExpanded by mutableStateOf(false)&#10;        private set&#10;&#10;    private var searchJob: Job? = null&#10;&#10;    fun updateQuery(newQuery: String) {&#10;        query = newQuery&#10;        searchJob?.cancel()&#10;        searchJob = coroutineScope.launch {&#10;            delay(300)  // debounce&#10;            suggestions = if (newQuery.isNotEmpty()) {&#10;                SuggestionEngine.getSuggestions(newQuery)&#10;            } else emptyList()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun expand() { isExpanded = true }&#10;    fun collapse() { isExpanded = false; suggestions = emptyList() }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// remember 工厂函数&#10;@Composable&#10;fun rememberSearchBarState(initialQuery: String = &quot;&quot;): SearchBarState {&#10;    val scope = rememberCoroutineScope()&#10;    return remember(initialQuery) { SearchBarState(initialQuery, scope) }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用&#10;@Composable&#10;fun SearchScreen() {&#10;    val searchState = rememberSearchBarState()&#10;    SearchBar(state = searchState)&#10;    SuggestionList(suggestions = searchState.suggestions)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// State Holder：封装复杂 UI 逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchBarState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    initialQuery: String = \"\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val coroutineScope: CoroutineScope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var query by mutableStateOf(initialQuery)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        private set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var suggestions by mutableStateOf&#x3C;List&#x3C;String>>(emptyList())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        private set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var isExpanded by mutableStateOf(false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        private set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var searchJob: Job? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun updateQuery(newQuery: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        query = newQuery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        searchJob?.cancel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        searchJob = coroutineScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            delay(300)  // debounce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            suggestions = if (newQuery.isNotEmpty()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                SuggestionEngine.getSuggestions(newQuery)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            } else emptyList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun expand() { isExpanded = true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun collapse() { isExpanded = false; suggestions = emptyList() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// remember 工厂函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun rememberSearchBarState(initialQuery: String = \"\"): SearchBarState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val scope = rememberCoroutineScope()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return remember(initialQuery) { SearchBarState(initialQuery, scope) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun SearchScreen() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val searchState = rememberSearchBarState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SearchBar(state = searchState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SuggestionList(suggestions = searchState.suggestions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"viewmodel-集成-业务状态提升\">ViewModel 集成：业务状态提升</h2><p>对于需要跨配置变更存活、与 Repository 交互的状态，提升到 ViewModel：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// ViewModel 持有业务状态&#10;class ProductListViewModel(&#10;    private val repository: ProductRepository,&#10;    private val savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    // UI 状态：单一数据类封装所有屏幕状态&#10;    data class UiState(&#10;        val products: List&lt;Product&gt; = emptyList(),&#10;        val isLoading: Boolean = false,&#10;        val error: String? = null,&#10;        val selectedCategory: Category = Category.ALL&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(UiState())&#10;    val uiState: StateFlow&lt;UiState&gt; = _uiState.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    // 事件处理&#10;    fun selectCategory(category: Category) {&#10;        _uiState.update { it.copy(selectedCategory = category, isLoading = true) }&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            val products = repository.getByCategory(category)&#10;            _uiState.update { it.copy(products = products, isLoading = false) }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Screen Composable：桥接 ViewModel 与 UI&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ProductListScreen(&#10;    viewModel: ProductListViewModel = viewModel()&#10;) {&#10;    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;&#10;    ProductListContent(&#10;        state = uiState,&#10;        onCategorySelect = viewModel::selectCategory&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 纯 UI 组件：只接收状态和回调&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ProductListContent(&#10;    state: ProductListViewModel.UiState,&#10;    onCategorySelect: (Category) -&gt; Unit,&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier&#10;) {&#10;    Column(modifier) {&#10;        CategoryTabs(&#10;            selected = state.selectedCategory,&#10;            onSelect = onCategorySelect&#10;        )&#10;        when {&#10;            state.isLoading -&gt; LoadingIndicator()&#10;            state.error != null -&gt; ErrorMessage(state.error)&#10;            else -&gt; ProductGrid(state.products)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ViewModel 持有业务状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ProductListViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository: ProductRepository,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // UI 状态：单一数据类封装所有屏幕状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class UiState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val products: List&#x3C;Product> = emptyList(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val isLoading: Boolean = false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val error: String? = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val selectedCategory: Category = Category.ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(UiState())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState: StateFlow&#x3C;UiState> = _uiState.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 事件处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun selectCategory(category: Category) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _uiState.update { it.copy(selectedCategory = category, isLoading = true) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val products = repository.getByCategory(category)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.update { it.copy(products = products, isLoading = false) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Screen Composable：桥接 ViewModel 与 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ProductListScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewModel: ProductListViewModel = viewModel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ProductListContent(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state = uiState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onCategorySelect = viewModel::selectCategory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 纯 UI 组件：只接收状态和回调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ProductListContent(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state: ProductListViewModel.UiState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onCategorySelect: (Category) -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column(modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CategoryTabs(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            selected = state.selectedCategory,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onSelect = onCategorySelect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state.isLoading -> LoadingIndicator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state.error != null -> ErrorMessage(state.error)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else -> ProductGrid(state.products)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"避免-prop-drilling\">避免 Prop Drilling</h2><p>当状态需要穿越多层组件时，有三种策略避免逐层传递：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 策略 1：CompositionLocal（适合低频变化的环境值）&#10;val LocalUserPreferences = compositionLocalOf&lt;UserPreferences&gt; {&#10;    error(&quot;No UserPreferences provided&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun App() {&#10;    CompositionLocalProvider(LocalUserPreferences provides userPrefs) {&#10;        // 深层子组件直接读取，无需逐层传参&#10;        DeepNestedComponent()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 策略 2：Slot 模式（通过 content lambda 注入）&#10;@Composable&#10;fun PageScaffold(&#10;    topBar: @Composable () -&gt; Unit,&#10;    content: @Composable (PaddingValues) -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    Scaffold(topBar = topBar, content = content)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 策略 3：拆分屏幕级与组件级状态&#10;// Screen 层持有所有需要的状态，只给子组件传它需要的切片&#10;@Composable&#10;fun OrderScreen(viewModel: OrderViewModel = viewModel()) {&#10;    val state by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;&#10;    Column {&#10;        // OrderHeader 只需要 userName 和 orderCount&#10;        OrderHeader(userName = state.userName, orderCount = state.orders.size)&#10;        // OrderList 只需要 orders&#10;        OrderList(orders = state.orders, onItemClick = viewModel::selectOrder)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 策略 1：CompositionLocal（适合低频变化的环境值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val LocalUserPreferences = compositionLocalOf&#x3C;UserPreferences> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    error(\"No UserPreferences provided\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    CompositionLocalProvider(LocalUserPreferences provides userPrefs) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 深层子组件直接读取，无需逐层传参</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        DeepNestedComponent()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 策略 2：Slot 模式（通过 content lambda 注入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun PageScaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    topBar: @Composable () -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: @Composable (PaddingValues) -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Scaffold(topBar = topBar, content = content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 策略 3：拆分屏幕级与组件级状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Screen 层持有所有需要的状态，只给子组件传它需要的切片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun OrderScreen(viewModel: OrderViewModel = viewModel()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val state by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // OrderHeader 只需要 userName 和 orderCount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OrderHeader(userName = state.userName, orderCount = state.orders.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // OrderList 只需要 orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OrderList(orders = state.orders, onItemClick = viewModel::selectOrder)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"状态提升的决策流程\">状态提升的决策流程</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 问自己这些问题来决定状态放在哪里：&#10;// Q1: 这个状态只有一个 Composable 使用吗？&#10;//     → YES: remember 在该 Composable 内部&#10;//&#10;// Q2: 多个 Composable 共享且是纯 UI 逻辑？&#10;//     → YES: 提升到最近公共父 Composable，或用 State Holder&#10;//&#10;// Q3: 需要跨配置变更存活？&#10;//     → YES: 提升到 ViewModel&#10;//&#10;// Q4: 需要跨进程存活（进程死亡后恢复）？&#10;//     → YES: 使用 rememberSaveable 或 SavedStateHandle&#10;//&#10;// Q5: 是全局环境值（主题、语言、用户偏好）？&#10;//     → YES: 使用 CompositionLocal\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 问自己这些问题来决定状态放在哪里：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Q1: 这个状态只有一个 Composable 使用吗？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     → YES: remember 在该 Composable 内部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Q2: 多个 Composable 共享且是纯 UI 逻辑？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     → YES: 提升到最近公共父 Composable，或用 State Holder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Q3: 需要跨配置变更存活？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     → YES: 提升到 ViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Q4: 需要跨进程存活（进程死亡后恢复）？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     → YES: 使用 rememberSaveable 或 SavedStateHandle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Q5: 是全局环境值（主题、语言、用户偏好）？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     → YES: 使用 CompositionLocal</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>状态提升让组件无状态——接收 state + 发送 event，实现单向数据流</li>\n<li><code>remember</code> 用于 UI 临时状态；State Holder 用于复杂 UI 逻辑；ViewModel 用于业务状态</li>\n<li>避免 Prop Drilling 的策略：CompositionLocal（环境值）、Slot 模式（内容注入）、状态切片</li>\n<li>单一 UiState 数据类封装屏幕所有状态，避免多个独立 StateFlow 导致不一致</li>\n<li>提升决策流程：一个组件用？多组件共享？跨配置变更？跨进程？全局环境？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"side-effects-lifecycle\">副作用与生命周期</a>——副作用应在状态提升的哪一层执行</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../android-development/architecture-components/viewmodel\">Android 开发基础 · ViewModel</a>——ViewModel 的创建、作用域与 SavedStateHandle</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../kotlin-advanced/coroutines/flow-operators\">Kotlin 进阶 · Flow 操作符</a>——StateFlow、SharedFlow 在状态管理中的运用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"状态提升模式","id":"状态提升模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"无状态组件设计","id":"无状态组件设计"},{"level":2,"text":"State Holder 模式","id":"state-holder-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"ViewModel 集成：业务状态提升","id":"viewmodel-集成-业务状态提升"},{"level":2,"text":"避免 Prop Drilling","id":"避免-prop-drilling"},{"level":2,"text":"状态提升的决策流程","id":"状态提升的决策流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Navigation Compose 进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/architecture/navigation-compose"},"next":{"title":"Compose 编译器原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/advanced/compose-compiler-internals"}}